[181.836394, "o", " = pd.concat(ordered_results, ignore_index=True)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Fix 5: Proper Termination (both files"]
[181.836422, "o", ")\r\n```python\r\n# Coordinator sends DONE signals\r\nfor i in range(3):\r\n    sender.send(pickle.dumps((\"DONE\", None, None)))\r\n\r\n# Work"]
[181.836455, "o", "ers handle DONE signal\r\nif msg_type == \"DONE\":\r\n    break\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Results\r\n\r\n**Before fixes:**\r\n- Output:"]
[181.836485, "o", " 12,000 rows\r\n- Value range: [0.0, >1.0] ❌\r\n- Comparison to reference: Fai"]
[181.836513, "o", "led\r\n\r\n**After fixes:**\r\n- Output: 50,000 rows ✓\r\n- Value range: [0.0, 0.79"]
[181.836544, "o", "98] ✓\r\n- Comparison to reference: **PERFECT MATCH (0.0"]
[181.836583, "o", " difference)** ✓\r\n\r\n## Key Lesson\r\n\r\nFor distributed TF-IDF (or any ML feature extraction):\r\n1. **Fit once on all data** to build vocabulary/statistics\r\n2. **Share the fitted model**"]
[181.836614, "o", " with all workers\r\n3. **Workers only transform** using the shared "]
[181.836673, "o", "model\r\n4. Never fit on subsets - it breaks the mat\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.836702, "o", "> "]
[181.836921, "o", "# Distributed TF-IDF Pipeline Bug Fix Summary\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.836955, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.836988, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.837016, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.837049, "o", "## Problem\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.837075, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.8371, "o", "> "]
[181.837295, "o", "The distributed feature extraction pipeline was producing incorrect output:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.837319, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.837348, "o", "> "]
[181.837457, "o", "- Only 12k rows instead of 50k (missing data)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.837482, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.837511, "o", "> "]
[181.837662, "o", "- Invalid tf-idf scores > 1.0 (mathematically impossible)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.837688, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.837717, "o", "> "]
[181.837856, "o", "- No errors or crashes (silent data corruption)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.837882, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.837916, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.837949, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.838013, "o", "## Root Causes Identified\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.838041, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.838077, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.838228, "o", "### 1. **Incorrect Vocabulary Management (CRITICAL)**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.838259, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.838285, "o", "> "]
[181.838469, "o", "Each worker was calling `vectorizer.fit_transform()` on individual chunks:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.838495, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.838531, "o", "```python\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.83856, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.838686, "o", "# WRONG - each chunk gets its own vocabulary\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.838709, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.838739, "o", "> "]
[181.838869, "o", "vectorizer = TfidfVectorizer(max_features=100)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.838895, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.83892, "o", "> "]
[181.839095, "o", "tfidf_matrix = vectorizer.fit_transform(texts)  # Fits on chunk only!\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.839129, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.839159, "o", "```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.839188, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.839214, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.839308, "o", "**Why this caused invalid scores:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.83933, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.839359, "o", "> "]
[181.839506, "o", "- TF-IDF requires a unified vocabulary across ALL documents\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.83953, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.839559, "o", "> "]
[181.839701, "o", "- Each chunk built its own vocabulary with different terms\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.839729, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.839946, "o", "- IDF (inverse document frequency) was calculated only within each chunk\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.839975, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.840154, "o", "- This produced invalid scores and incompatible feature columns\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.840182, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.840211, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.84024, "o", "> "]
[181.840308, "o", "### 2. **Column Misalignment**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.84033, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.840358, "o", "> "]
[181.840565, "o", "Workers returned DataFrames with different column names (different vocabularies):\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.840588, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.840608, "o", "> "]
[181.840766, "o", "- Worker 1 chunk: columns ['apple', 'banana', 'cherry', ...]\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.840788, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.840816, "o", "> "]
[181.840973, "o", "- Worker 2 chunk: columns ['dog', 'elephant', 'fox', ...]\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.840995, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.841026, "o", "> "]
[181.841234, "o", "- Coordinator's `pd.concat()` created union of all columns, filling missing values\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.84127, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.841419, "o", "- Result: sparse, misaligned data with wrong dimensions\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.841441, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.841469, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.841497, "o", "> "]
[181.841591, "o", "### 3. **Message Loss at Startup**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.84162, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.841649, "o", "> "]
[181.841785, "o", "Coordinator sent chunks immediately after binding sockets:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.841813, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.841863, "o", "```python\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.841892, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.841921, "o", "> "]
[181.841995, "o", "sender.bind(\"tcp://127.0.0.1:5557\")\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.842021, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.842056, "o", "> "]
[181.842179, "o", "# Immediately sends chunks - workers not connected yet!\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.842205, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.842271, "o", "for chunk in chunks:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.842299, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.842367, "o", "    sender.send(chunk)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.842395, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.842424, "o", "```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.84245, "o", "> "]
[181.842638, "o", "ZeroMQ PUSH sockets can drop messages if no PULL sockets are connected.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.842671, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.842697, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.842794, "o", "### 4. **Poor Result Tracking**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.842816, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.842853, "o", "> "]
[181.842989, "o", "Coordinator used a list instead of dict for results:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.843012, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.843041, "o", "> "]
[181.84307, "o", "```python\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.843099, "o", "> "]
[181.843209, "o", "results = []  # Can't detect missing chunks\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.843238, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.843385, "o", "results.append(result_df)  # No chunk ID tracking\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.843413, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.843439, "o", "```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.843469, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.843632, "o", "Timeout-based completion meant lost chunks went undetected.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.84366, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.843686, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.843714, "o", "> "]
[181.843744, "o", "## Fixes Applied\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.843772, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.8438, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.843841, "o", "> "]
[181.843955, "o", "### Fix 1: Unified Vocabulary (coordinator.py)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.843979, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.844008, "o", "> "]
[181.844033, "o", "```python\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.844059, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.844146, "o", "# Fit vectorizer on ALL data ONCE\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.844175, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.844308, "o", "vectorizer = TfidfVectorizer(max_features=100)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.844328, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.844357, "o", "> "]
[181.844418, "o", "texts = df[\"text\"].tolist()\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.844447, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.84463, "o", "vectorizer.fit(texts)  # Build vocabulary from all 50k documents\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.844652, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.844676, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.844704, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.84481, "o", "# Send fitted vectorizer to all workers\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.844857, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.844911, "o", "for i in range(3):\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.844942, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.84497, "o", "> "]
[181.845109, "o", "    sender.send(pickle.dumps((\"VECTORIZER\", vectorizer)))\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.845132, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.845155, "o", "> ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.845189, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.845214, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.845357, "o", "### Fix 2: Transform-Only in Workers (worker.py)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.845385, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.84542, "o", "```python\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.845447, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.845574, "o", "# Receive fitted vectorizer from coordinator\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.845609, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.845635, "o", "> "]
[181.845762, "o", "msg_type, vectorizer = pickle.loads(receiver.recv())\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.845784, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.845814, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.845845, "o", "> "]
[181.845943, "o", "# Use transform() only - don't fit!\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.845968, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.845995, "o", "> "]
[181.846166, "o", "tfidf_matrix = vectorizer.transform(texts)  # Uses shared vocabulary\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.846194, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.846224, "o", "```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.846252, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.84628, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.846417, "o", "### Fix 3: Startup Synchronization (coordinator.py)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.846445, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.846478, "o", "```python\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.846514, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.846597, "o", "# Wait for workers to connect\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.846623, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.846666, "o", "time.sleep(2)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.846695, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.846725, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.846753, "o", "> "]
[181.8468, "o", "# Send vectorizer first\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.846869, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.846901, "o", "for i in range(3):\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.84693, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.847025, "o", "    sender.send(vectorizer_msg)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.847053, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.847104, "o", "time.sleep(0.5)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.847131, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.847165, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.847194, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.847221, "o", "# Then send chunks\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.847249, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.84737, "o", "for chunk_id, chunk in enumerate(chunks):\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.847399, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.847481, "o", "    sender.send(chunk_msg)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.847509, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.847528, "o", "```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.847562, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.847588, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.847731, "o", "### Fix 4: Proper Result Tracking (coordinator.py)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.847754, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.847773, "o", "> "]
[181.84781, "o", "```python\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.847851, "o", "> "]
[181.847951, "o", "# Use dict to track results by chunk_id\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.84798, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.848022, "o", "results = {}\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.84805, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.848145, "o", "while len(results) < num_chunks:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.848174, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.848199, "o", "> "]
[181.848335, "o", "    chunk_id, result_df = pickle.loads(receiver.recv())\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.848362, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.848461, "o", "    results[chunk_id] = result_df\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.848495, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.848524, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.8486, "o", "# Check for missing chunks\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.848629, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.848714, "o", "if len(results) < num_chunks:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.848743, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.848922, "o", "    missing = set(range(num_chunks)) - set(results.keys())\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.848953, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.848982, "o", "> "]
[181.849064, "o", "    print(f\"Missing chunks: {missing}\")\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.849087, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.849117, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.849145, "o", "> "]
[181.849211, "o", "# Aggregate in correct order\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.849234, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.849271, "o", "> "]
[181.849414, "o", "ordered_results = [results[i] for i in sorted(results.keys())]\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.84944, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.849612, "o", "final_df = pd.concat(ordered_results, ignore_index=True)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.849639, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.849668, "o", "```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.849697, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.849723, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.849858, "o", "### Fix 5: Proper Termination (both files)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.84988, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.84991, "o", "> "]
[181.849935, "o", "```python\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.849971, "o", "> "]
[181.850042, "o", "# Coordinator sends DONE signals\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.85007, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.850127, "o", "for i in range(3):\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.850157, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.850302, "o", "    sender.send(pickle.dumps((\"DONE\", None, None)))\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.850338, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.850364, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.850448, "o", "# Workers handle DONE signal\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.850477, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.850547, "o", "if msg_type == \"DONE\":\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.850575, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.850608, "o", "    break\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.850633, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.850657, "o", "> ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.850686, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.850722, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.850751, "o", "## Results\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.850782, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.850809, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.850848, "o", "> "]
[181.850881, "o", "**Before fixes:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.850914, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.850943, "o", "> "]
[181.850978, "o", "- Output: 12,000 rows\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.851002, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.851028, "o", "> "]
[181.851098, "o", "- Value range: [0.0, >1.0] ❌\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.85112, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.851148, "o", "> "]
[181.851226, "o", "- Comparison to reference: Failed\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.851255, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.851285, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.851314, "o", "> "]
[181.851347, "o", "**After fixes:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.851379, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.851407, "o", "> "]
[181.851445, "o", "- Output: 50,000 rows ✓\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.851471, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.851568, "o", "- Value range: [0.0, 0.7998] ✓\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.851594, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.851781, "o", "- Comparison to reference: **PERFECT MATCH (0.0 difference)** ✓\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.851809, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.851858, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.8519, "o", "## Key Lesson\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.851923, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.851955, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.851979, "o", "> "]
[181.852118, "o", "For distributed TF-IDF (or any ML feature extraction):\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.852148, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[181.852314, "o", "1. **Fit once on all data** to build vocabulary/statistics\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.852341, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.852369, "o", "> "]
[181.852481, "o", "2. **Share the fitted model** with all workers\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.852509, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.852523, "o", "> "]
[181.852672, "o", "3. **Workers only transform** using the shared model\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.852703, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.852738, "o", "> "]
[181.852918, "o", "4. Never fit on subsets - it breaks the mathematical assumptions!\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.852942, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[181.85297, "o", "> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.85413, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
